<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Est</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esta</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogol Vashti kuom bedo mikach ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1"/>Ma e gima notimore e ndalo loch Ahasuerus, e kinde mane orito pinje mia achiel gi piero ariyo gabiriyo chakre India nyaka Kush. <verse eid="EST 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2"/>E kindeno ruoth Ahasuerus norito loch Kodak e dala maduongʼ mochiel motegno mar Susa, <verse eid="EST 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3"/>to e higa mar adek mar lochne noloso sawo ne jodonge gi jotije duto gi jotend lweny man Pasia gi Media gi joka ruoth, gi jodongo duto mag pinje bende ne nitie.<verse eid="EST 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4"/>Kuom ndalo mia achiel gi piero aboro nonyisogi mwandu mathoth mag pinyruodhe gi ber kod teko miwuoro mar lochne. <verse eid="EST 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5"/>Ka ndalogo noserumo, ruoth notimo sawo ni ji duto mane odak e dala maduongʼ mochiel motegno mar Susa. Sawono notim e siwandha mar dala ruoth kendo nokawo ndalo abiriyo. <verse eid="EST 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6"/>E siwandhano ne nitie pasia marachar gi marambulu molier kotwe gi tonde momin gi lewni marochere gi maralik kolier e bonje mar fedha manotwe e sirni mapakni. Kombego nolos gi dhahabu gi fedha kendo siwandhano nobug gi kite mopogore opogore ma nengogi tek ma kitgi opogore opogore. <verse eid="EST 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7"/>Ji ne madho divai gi kikombe mopogore opogore kendo divai ne ngʼeny mana ka mar ruoth adier nikech ne chunye ngʼwon. <verse eid="EST 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8"/>Ruoth nogolo chik ni mondo oyiene ngʼato ka ngʼato mondo omadh gima odwaro, nimar ruoth nosegolo chik ne jotich mapogo divai ni mondo omi ngʼato ka ngʼato math modwaro.<verse eid="EST 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9"/>Vashti mikach ruoth bende ne oloso sawo ne mon modak e dala ruoth Ahasuerus.<verse eid="EST 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10"/>Chiengʼ mar abiriyo kane divai oromo ruoth Ahasuerus nochiko jotichne mabwoch abiriyo magin Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zethar gi Karkas, <verse eid="EST 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11"/>mondo okel Vashti ma mikache ire ka orwako osimbo mar mikach ruoth, kendo mondo onyis ji to gi jotelo kaka ojaber, nikech nober neno. <verse eid="EST 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12"/>To ka joote notero wach ma ruoth nochiko, Vashti ma mikach ruoth notamore dhi. Eka ruoth nobedo makwiny kendo iye nowangʼ ahinya.<verse eid="EST 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13"/>Kaka ne en timgi mondo ruoth openj wach kuom joma olony e weche mag chike gi kaka ingʼado bura kare, nowuoyo gi joma riek, manongʼeyo weche mag ndalo, <verse eid="EST 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14"/>bende ne gin joma ruoth ogeno ahinya mane bet machiegni kode kaka Karshena, Shetha, Admatha, Tarshish, Meres, Marsena gi Memukan, mane gin jodongo abiriyo mag Pasia gi Media mane nyalo donjo ir ruoth e sa asaya bende ne gin joma oluor kendo ogen e pinyruoth.<verse eid="EST 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15"/>Nopenjogi niya, “Kaluwore gi chik, angʼo monego timne Vashti ma mikacha? Nikech osedagi winjo chik mar ruoth Ahasuerus mane oorogo jotichne mabwoch ire.”<verse eid="EST 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16"/>Eka Memukan nodwoko wach e nyim ruoth gi jotelo niya, “Vashti mikach ruoth osetimo tim marach ne jotelo gi ji duto man e gwenge man e bwo loch ruoth Ahasuerus. <verse eid="EST 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17"/>Nimar tim ma mikach ruoth otimoni, ka mon mamoko ongʼeyo, to gibiro chayo chwogi kagiwacho ni, ‘Ruoth Ahasuerus nochiko mikache ma Vashti mondo okel e nyime, to nodagi biro.’ <verse eid="EST 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18"/>Kata mana kawuononi mond jodong Pasia gi Media ma owinjo tim ma mikachi otimo biro mana timo ne jodong ruoth tim machal gi mano. Achaya gi ich wangʼ biro dhi nyime maonge gikone.<verse eid="EST 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19"/>“Emomiyo, ka ber ne ruoth to mondo ogol chik maka ruoth kendo mondo ondiki wachni e chike mag Pasia gi Media, mosiko ma ok nyal gol ni Vashti kik chak bi e nyim ruoth Ahasuerus kendo. Bende ruoth onego ket ngʼato kare malongʼo man-gi chia moloye. <verse eid="EST 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20"/>Eka chik ma ruoth ogolono nolandre pinye duto, kendo mon duto biro luoro chwogi, maonge modongʼ.”<verse eid="EST 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21"/>Ruoth gi jodonge ne mor gi rieko mane ongʼadni, eka ruoth notimo kaka Memukan nowacho. <verse eid="EST 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22"/>Nooro baruwa moketoe sei mare ni pinjeruodhi duto, moro ka moro nondikne gi dhogi giwegi kanyisogi malongʼo e dhok ma giwinjo ni chwo duto obed gi teko mar rito miechgi gi joma odak e miechgigo.<verse eid="EST 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Esta oket mondo obed mikach ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1"/>Kane mirimb ruoth Ahasuerus noserumo, noparo gima ne Vashti otimo, to gi chik mane osegolo. <verse eid="EST 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2"/>To jotich matiyone ruoth nowachone niya, “Owinjore mondo odwar ne ruoth nyiri man-gi chia mapok ongʼeyo chwo. <verse eid="EST 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3"/>Kuom mano yier ji mondo odhi omany nyiri mabeyo e pinje duto manie bwo lochni, kendo gikelgi e dalani Susa mondo oketgi e lwet Hegai ma jatich ruoth mabwoch mane jarit mon; kendo mondo omigi modhi mag loso del mondo gibed maberie moloyo. <verse eid="EST 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4"/>Bangʼe to owe nyako molombo wangʼ ruoth obed mikach ruoth kar Vashti.” Paroni ne ber ne ruoth mi notimo kamano.<verse eid="EST 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5"/>E dala mochiel mar Susa ne nitie ja-Yahudi moro ma ja-dhood Benjamin ma nyinge Modekai wuod Jair, ma wuod Shimei, wuod Kish, <verse eid="EST 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6"/>mane ogol Jerusalem gi Nebukadneza ruoth Babulon, ma gin e joma ne oter e twech kaachiel gi Jehoyakin ruodh Juda. <verse eid="EST 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7"/>Modekai ne nigi nyamin, ma nyar owadgi wuon-gi ma nyinge ne Hadasa, mane opidho nikech ne en kich. Nyakoni ma bende ne ongʼere gi nying machielo ni Esta ne en jachia, kendo ne osekawe mobedo ka nyare, bangʼ tho wuon gi min.<verse eid="EST 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8"/>Kane chik ruoth kod lendone osetim, nyiri mangʼeny ne okel e dala mochiel mar Susa e od mon mi oketgi e lwet Hegai mondo oritgi. Esta bende ne okel moter e dala ruoth mokete kaachiel gi mon-go ka Hegai ritogi. <verse eid="EST 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9"/>Nyakono ne longʼo kendo noyudo ngʼwono e wangʼ Hegai. Nomiye modhi miwirruokgo gi chiemo mabeyo mana gisano. Nomiye nyiri abiriyo moyier moa e od ruoth bende ne ogole motere kama berie moloyo e od mon kanyo.<verse eid="EST 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10"/>Esta ne pok onyiso ngʼato ni en nyar oganda mane, kata nonro mar anywolane, nikech Modekai ne osekwere ni kik onyis ngʼato wachno. <verse eid="EST 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11"/>Pile ka pile Modekai ne wuotho e dala kanyo machiegni gi koma ochiel ni mon mondo ongʼe kaka Esta dhi kod gik mane timorene.<verse eid="EST 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12"/>Kane nyako moro amora pok oyudo thuolo mar dhi ir ruoth Ahasuerus, nimiye dweche apar gariyo mane owirore gi modhi maloso del mane oket ni mon-go mondo owirrego, dweche auchiel mokwongo ne imiyogi mo molos gi mane-mane mondo giwirrego, to dweche auchiel mamoko ne giwirore gi modhi moko mangʼwe ngʼar. <verse eid="EST 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13"/>Ma e kaka ne onego odhi ir ruoth: Gimoro amora modwaro lichorego kodhi e od ruoth ne imiye koa e od mon. <verse eid="EST 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14"/>Kane ochopo odhiambo ne odhi kuno to kochopo okinyi, to noduogo e od mon komachielo mirito gi Shashgaz, ma en bende ne en bwoch mane ruoth oketo mondo orit monde. Ne ok onyal dok ir ruoth makmana ka ruoth ne mor kode moluonge gi nyinge.<verse eid="EST 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15"/>Kane chiengʼ mane Esta onego dhi ir ruoth ochopo, ne ok okwayo gimoro mondo odhigo, makmana gik mane Hegai, jatich ruoth mabwoch mane rito mon, omiye. Esta ne en nyar Abihail, ma owadgi wuon Modekai, mane Modekai opidho kaka nyare. Ji duto mane oneno Esta ne mor kode. <verse eid="EST 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16"/>Notere ir ruoth Ahasuerus e ot ma ruoth dakie e dwe mar apar miluongo ni Tebeth, e hike mar abiriyo mar lochne.<verse eid="EST 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17"/>Koro ruoth ne ohero Esta kendo chunye ne otwere kuome moloyo nyiri duto, nolombo wangʼ ruoth, kendo ruoth noyie kode moloyo nyiri mamoko. Mine osidhone osimbo mar duongʼ, mi okete obedo mikache kar Vashti. <verse eid="EST 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18"/>Ruoth noloso nyasi maduongʼ mirwakogo Esta, nolose ne jodonge gi jotelo duto, noloso chiengʼno mondo obed chiengʼ yweyo maonge tich e pinyruodhe duto ka ooro ni ji mich mabup.<verse eid="EST 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Modekai ofwenyo ni jomoko dwaro nego ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19"/>Kane ochak ochan nyiri mabeyogi kendo Modekai noyudo obet e dhoranga ruoth. <verse eid="EST 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20"/>To Esta ne pok owacho ne ngʼato angʼata nonro mar anywolane kata oganda mowuokie mana kaka ne Modekai osechike mondo otim, ne pod orito chik mane omiye gi Modekai mana kaka ne otimo kane pod odak kode kopidhe.<verse eid="EST 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21"/>Kane Modekai obet e dhoranga ruoth kaka nojabet, Bigthana gi Teresh, ariyo kuom jotend ruoth mane rito rangach, nokecho kendo negichano mondo gineg ruoth Ahasuerus. <verse eid="EST 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22"/>To Modekai nofwenyo wachgino monyiso Esta ma mikach ruoth, mane otero wach ne ruoth konyiso ni Modekai ema owachone. <verse eid="EST 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23"/>Kane onon wachno moyud ni en adieri, jotelo ariyogo nolier e yath. Magi duto ne ondiki e kitap weche mag ruodhi mana ka ruoth neno.<verse eid="EST 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Haman ochano mondo otiek jo-Yahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1"/>Bangʼ ka gigi nosetimore, ruoth Ahasuerus nomiyo Haman wuod Hamedatha, ja-Agag duongʼ moloyo jodongo duto. <verse eid="EST 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2"/>Jotich joka ruoth duto mane ni e rangach ne goyo chonggi piny ka gimiyo Haman duongʼ gi luor, nikech ruoth noseketo chik mondo otimne kamano. To Modekai to ne odagi goyone chonge piny kamiyego duongʼ.<verse eid="EST 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3"/>Eka jotich joka ruoth mane ni e rangach nopenjo Modekai niya, “Angʼo momiyo idagi timo chik ma ruoth oketo?” <verse eid="EST 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4"/>Pile ka pile ne giwuoyo kode, to nodagi timo kaka chik dwaro. Omiyo neginyiso Haman wachno mondo one anena kaka tim Modekai-ni inyalo yiego nimar nosewachonegi ni en ja-Yahudi.<verse eid="EST 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5"/>Kane Haman oneno ni Modekai ok nyal goyone chonge piny kata miye luor, mirima nomake. <verse eid="EST 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6"/>To kaka ne osengʼeyo oganda ma Modekai ae, ne ochayo wach nego mana Modekai kende. Kar timo mano, Haman nodwaro yo monyalo tiekogo oganda gi Modekai duto, ma gin jo-Yahudi, e pinyruodh Ahasuerus duto.<verse eid="EST 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7"/>E higa mar apar gariyo mar ruoth Ahasuerus, e dwe mokwongo, miluongo ni Nisan negigoyo ombulu (miluongo ni <char style="tl">pur</char>) e nyim Haman mondo giyier odiechiengʼ gi dwe. To ombulu nolwar e dwe mar apar gariyo dwe miluongo ni Adar.<verse eid="EST 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8"/>Eka Haman nowachone ruoth Ahasuerus niya, “Nitie oganda moro moke e kind ogendini manie pinyruodhi ma timbegi opogore gi mag ogendini duto ma ok oluoro kata mana chike mag ruoth; omiyo ok en wach maber ka ruoth oweyogi aweya. <verse eid="EST 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9"/>Ka ber ne ruoth to mondo ogol chik mondo otiekgi, an to abiro golo fedha maromo kilo alufu mia angʼwen mondo okete kar keno mar joka ruoth mondo ochul joma biro tiyo tijno.”<verse eid="EST 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10"/>Eka ruoth nogolo terene e lwete mi omiyo Haman wuod Hamedatha, ja-Agag, ma jawasik jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="EST 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11"/>Ruoth nowachone Haman niya, “We golo pesani, to timne jogo gima in ema ihero.”<verse eid="EST 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12"/>Kane ochopo tarik apar gadek mar dwe mokwongo, noluong jogoro mag joka ruoth. Negindiko barupe madhi e piny ka piny kendo e dhok mar oganda ka oganda gik mane Haman ochiko mondo ondiki ne jotelo morito pinje mopogore opogore gi jodongo mag ogendini. Barupegi nondik gi nying ruoth Ahasuerus owuon mi ogo sei gi tere mar ruoth. <verse eid="EST 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13"/>Joote matero barupegi noor e pinje duto manie bwo loch ruoth kogolo chik ni jo-Yahudi duto nyaka negi matiek pep, bed ni gin jomatindo, joma oti, mon gi nyithindo matindo e odiechiengʼ achiel tarik apar gadek, dwe mar apar gariyo, miluongo ni Adar, kendo mondo oyak mwandugi. <verse eid="EST 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14"/>Nondik wechegi moketgi kaka chik e pinje duto mondo oland ne ogendini gi dhout pinje mondo obed moikore ne chiengʼno.<verse eid="EST 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15"/>Kaluwore gi chik ruoth, jootego nowuok piyo piyo mine oket milomeno e ohinga mar dala Susa. Ruoth gi Haman nobet piny mondo omethi, to dala maduongʼ mar Susa nobwok kowinjo wachno.<verse eid="EST 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Modekai okwayo Esta mondo okony jo-Yahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1"/>Kane Modekai owinjo gigo duto mane osetimore, noyiecho lepe morwako pien gugru mobukore gi buru, kodhi e dala maduongʼ koywak kendo kogoyo nduru matek ka chunye lit. <verse eid="EST 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2"/>To nodhi mana nyaka e dhoranga ruoth nikech ne ok oyiene ngʼat morwako pien gugru mondo odonji. <verse eid="EST 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3"/>E piny ka piny mane wach ruoth ochopoe, kuyo nomako jo-Yahudi, ka gitweyo chiemo, ka giywak kendo ka gidengo. Thothgi nonindo e piende gugru ka gibukore gi buru.<verse eid="EST 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4"/>Kane jotich Esta ma nyiri gi mago machwo mabwoch okelone wach mar Modekai nokuyo ahinya. Noorone lewni mondo orwaki kar rwako pien gugru, to notamore kawogi. <verse eid="EST 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5"/>Eka Esta noluongo Hathak, achiel kuom jotich ruoth mabwoch manoketi mondo otine, noore ir Modekai mondo onone kuom gima chande.<verse eid="EST 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6"/>Omiyo Hathak nowuok modhi ir Modekai e paw dala maduongʼ mane ni e nyim dhoranga ruoth. <verse eid="EST 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7"/>Modekai nonyise gik moko duto mosetimorene, nonyise koda kar romb pesa ma Haman nosesingore nodhi chulo e kar keno mar joka ruoth mondo otiekgo jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="EST 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8"/>Nomiye kalatas mondikie weche mag tiekogi ma nondiki e dala mar Susa, mondo onyis Esta kendo olerne weche mondikgo, nowachone ni mondo okwaye mondo odhi e nyim ruoth kendo ohomb ruoth ongʼwon ne ogandane.<verse eid="EST 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9"/>Hathak nodok ir Esta monyise weche mane Modekai owacho. <verse eid="EST 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10"/>Eka nonyiso ngʼatno mondo owach ne Modekai niya, <verse eid="EST 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11"/>“Jotelo duto mag ruoth to gi ji duto moa e gwenge mag pinyruoth, ongʼeyo ni onge ngʼato angʼata madichwo kata ma dhako manyalo donjo ir ruoth e laru maiye ka ok ruoth ema oluonge to oket chik achiel kende ni nyaka nege. Makmana ka ruoth orieyo ludhe mar dhahabu kochomo ngʼatno eka ok nonege. Koro to osekawo ndalo piero adek kapok ruoth oluonga.”<verse eid="EST 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12"/>Kane onyis Modekai weche mane Esta owacho, <verse eid="EST 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13"/>nodwoko kowacho niya, “Kik ipar ni in kendi ema inikwo e dhood jo-Yahudi duto nikech in e od ruoth. <verse eid="EST 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14"/>To nikech ka ilingʼ e kinde ma kama, to jo-Yahudi noyud resruok e yo moro machielo, to in kod jood wuonu notieku. To ngʼama dingʼe ni ne ibiro e od ruoth e sa ma kama mana ni mondo ikonywa?”<verse eid="EST 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15"/>Eka Esta nooro dwoko ne Modekai kama: <verse eid="EST 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16"/>“Dhi ichok jo-Yahudi duto man Susa, mondo utwe chiemo kulemona. Kik uchiem kata metho kuom ndalo adek otieno gi odiechiengʼ. An gi nyiri matiyona bende wabiro tweyo chiemo kendo metho mana kaka un. Ka usetimo kamano, to abiro dhi ir ruoth, kata obedo ni chik ok oyie kamano. Ka ochuno ni nyaka atho, to anatho.”<verse eid="EST 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17"/>Omiyo Modekai nodhi motimo duto mane Esta ochiko mondo otim.<verse eid="EST 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kwayo mane Esta okwayo ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1"/>Chiengʼ mar adek Esta norwako lawe mar duongʼ kaka mikach ruoth mochungʼ e laru maiye mar dala ruoth, kama omanyore gi ot maduongʼ ma ruoth bedoe; Ruoth ne oyudo obedo e kome mar duongʼ e ot, kama omanyore gi dhoot. <verse eid="EST 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2"/>Kane oneno ruoth madhako miluongo ni Esta ma mikache kochungʼ e laru, nomor kode mi otingʼone ludhe mar dhahabu mane ni e lwete. Omiyo Esta nodhi momulo wi luth.<verse eid="EST 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3"/>Eka ruoth nopenjo Esta niya, “En angʼo? En angʼo midwaro kwayo? Kwa akwaya kata obed mana nus mar pinya, to ibiro miyi.”<verse eid="EST 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4"/>Esta nodwoko ruoth niya, “Ka ihera kendo ineno ni ber miya gima akwayo, to yie ibi gi Haman e nyasi maselosonu.”<verse eid="EST 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5"/>Ruoth nowacho mondo okel Haman piyo, mondo mi watim gima Esta okwayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:5">Omiyo ruoth kod Haman ne odhi e nyasi mane Esta oseloso. <verse eid="EST 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6"/>Kane onwangʼo gimadho divai, ruoth nochako openjo Esta niya, “Koro angʼo midwaro kwayo? Ibiro miyigo. En angʼo mikwayo? Kata obed nus mar pinya to oyieni mondo ikawe.”<verse eid="EST 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7"/>Eka Esta nodwoko niya, Kwayona gi dwarona ema: <verse eid="EST 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8"/>Ka ruoth otimona ngʼwono kendo ihera kendo ka iyie mondo itim kwayona, to yie mondo ruoth gi Haman mondo obi e nyasi ma kiny nalosnu. Eka abiro dwoko ruoth penjoneno.<verse eid="EST 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mirima omako Haman nikech Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9"/>Haman nowuok kanyo kamor kendo ka chunye opongʼ gi ilo. To kane oneno Modekai e dhoranga ruoth ka ok ochungʼ ne kata nyiso luor e nyime, mirima nomake nikech Modekai. <verse eid="EST 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10"/>Kata kamano, Haman nomako chunye mi nodhi dala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:10">Noluongo osiepene kamoro achiel gi Zeresh ma jaode. <verse eid="EST 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11"/>Haman nosungorenegi kaka en-gi mwandu mathoth, gi yawuowi mangʼeny, to gi kaka ruoth osemiye duongʼ moloyo jotelo gi jodongo mamoko. <verse eid="EST 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12"/>Haman nomedo wacho niya, “To ok mano kende, an kenda ema Esta mikach ruoth oluonga mondo adhi gi ruoth e nyasine moloso, to kiny bende oseluonga mondo wadhi gi ruoth. <verse eid="EST 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13"/>To magi duto ok miya mor kapod aneno ja-Yahudi ma Modekai kobet e dhoranga ruoth.”<verse eid="EST 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14"/>Jaode ma Zeresh gi osiepene duto nongʼadone rieko niya, “Gur yath ma borne oromo fut piero abiriyo gabich mi liere ji, kendo ikwa ruoth gokinyi mondo oneg Modekai kolier kanyo. Eka mondo idhi uchiem gi ruoth ka imor.” Parono nomoro Haman, mi nogero gima inegogo ji koliergi.<verse eid="EST 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Omi Modekai duongʼ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1"/>Otienono nindo notamore tero ruoth; mi nochiko mondo okelne Kitabu mondikie weche mag ndalo, kendo mondikie gik mosetimore e kinde mag lochne, mondo okel kendo osomne. <verse eid="EST 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2"/>Kitabuno noyud kondikie ni Modekai ema nofwenyo kaka Bigthana gi Teresh, jotelo mane rito dhoranga ruoth, nosechano mondo oneg ruoth Ahasuerus.<verse eid="EST 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3"/>Ruoth nopenjo niya, “Angʼo mosetim kimiyogo Modekai duongʼ kuom gima notimono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Jotichne nodwoko niya, “Onge gima osetimne.”<verse eid="EST 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4"/>Eka ruoth nopenjo niya, “En ngʼa manie laru?” Noyudo ka koro eka Haman donjo e laru ma oko mar dala ruoth mondo owuo gi ruoth kuom wach mar nego Modekai kolier e gima noselosone.<verse eid="EST 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5"/>Omiyo jotije nowachone niya, “Haman ema ochungʼ e laru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">Ruoth nogolo chik niya, “Kele ira ka.”<verse eid="EST 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6"/>Kane Haman osedonjo, ruoth nopenje niya, “Angʼo monego tim ne ngʼat ma ruoth dwaro miyo duongʼ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Koro Haman noparo kende niya, “Ere ngʼama ruoth dimi duongʼ ma ok an?” <verse eid="EST 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7"/>Omiyo nodwoko ruoth niya, “Ngʼama ruoth morgo mar miyo duongʼ, <verse eid="EST 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8"/>mondo okel lep ruoth mag duongʼ moserwako gi faras ma ruoth oseidho, man-gi osimbo mar joka ruoth kosidhne e wiye. <verse eid="EST 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9"/>Eka mondo gikaw lawno gi faras mondo gimi jatelo mogen, kendo girwak ngʼat ma ruoth morgo mar miyo duongʼ, ka gitelo e nyim faras motingʼe e yore mag dala maduongʼ, kendo ka gigoyo milome e nyime ni, ‘Ma e kaka itimo ne ngʼama ruoth morgo mar miyo duongʼ!’ ”<verse eid="EST 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10"/>Ruoth nochiko Haman kowacho niya, “Dhi piyo.” Kaw law gi faras mondo itim duto misewacho ne Modekai ma ja-Yahudi, mabetga e dhoranga ruoth. Kik iwe kata mana gimoro achiel kuom gik ma isewacho.<verse eid="EST 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11"/>Omiyo Haman nokawo law gi faras. Norwako ne Modekai lawno mokete oidho faras ka otelo nyime owuotho kode e yore mag dala maduongʼ ka owacho gi dwol maduongʼ niya, “Ma e kaka itimo ne ngʼat ma ruoth morgo mar miyo duongʼ!”<verse eid="EST 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12"/>Ka Modekai noseduogo e dhoranga ruoth. Haman to noreto kadok e ode, ka chunye opongʼ gi lit, <verse eid="EST 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13"/>kendo nonyiso Zeresh ma chiege gi osiepene duto gik moko duto mane otimorene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:13">Joma ngʼadone rieko gi Zeresh ma chiege nowachone niya, “Mano kaka rumo mari osechakore e nyim Modekai ma to en ja-Yahudi, ok ininyale kendo adier obiro miyo irum chuth!” <verse eid="EST 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14"/>Kane pod giwuoyo kode, jotich ruoth mabwoch nochopo mapiyo mokawo Haman ka gitere mondo odhi e nyasi ma Esta noseloso.<verse eid="EST 6:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Haman onegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1"/>Kuom mano, ruoth kod Haman nodhi chiemo gi Esta ma mikache, <verse eid="EST 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2"/>to kane oyudo gimadho divai chiengʼ mar ariyono, ruoth nopenjo mikache ma Esta niya, “Kwayoni en angʼo? Kwaya akwaya ma kata ka en nus mar pinya to ibiro miyigo?”<verse eid="EST 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3"/>Eka Esta ma mikach ruoth nodwoko niya, “Ka ayudo ngʼwono e nyimi, yaye ruoth, kendo ka berni jaduongʼ, to yie ikony ngimana, ma e kwayona, kendo akwayi ni yie ikech ogandana. Mano e ywakna. <verse eid="EST 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4"/>Nimar an kod ogandana osengʼiew-wa mondo otiekwa kendo onegwa nyaka warum chuth. Ka dabed ni ongʼiew-wa mondo wabed wasumbini machwo gi mamon kende, to dine alingʼ alingʼa, nikech mano ok en gima dine achandogo ruoth.”<verse eid="EST 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5"/>Ruoth Ahasuerus nopenjo Esta ma mikache niya, “En ngʼa? Ngʼatno ni kanye mosehedhore timo gima kamano?”<verse eid="EST 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6"/>Esta nowacho niya, “Jasadha ma jawasikwa en mana Haman ngʼat marach mobet butino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:6">Eka luoro maduongʼ nomako Haman e nyim ruoth gi mikache. <verse eid="EST 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7"/>Eka ruoth nochungʼ moweyo divai mane omadho ka mirima ohinge modhi oko e puoth joka ruoth. To Haman, kane oneno ni ruoth osengʼado buche kuom gima onego timne, nodongʼ chien kokwayo Esta mikach ruoth mondo ores ngimane.<verse eid="EST 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8"/>E seche mane ruoth odwogo koa e puodho mar dala ruoth kane odonjo e ot mane itimoe nyasi, noyudo ka Haman osenindo e kom maduongʼ mane Esta obetie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Ruoth nowuoyo matek ka obwok mowacho niya, “Odwaro kata mana mako mikacha e wangʼa kaneno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Kane ruoth pok otieko wuoyo, ne giumo wangʼ Haman. <verse eid="EST 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9"/>Eka Harbona, achiel kuom jotich ruoth mabwoch nowacho niya, “Gir nek ma borne oromo fut piero abiriyo gabich ochungʼ e bath od Haman. Noselose mondo oneg-go Modekai, ma wachne ne osekonyo ruoth.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Ruoth nowacho niya, “Kawuru gima nolosono mondo ulierego!” <verse eid="EST 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10"/>Omiyo neginego Haman e gima noseiko mondo oneg-go Modekai. Eka mirimb ruoth norumo.<verse eid="EST 7:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Chik mane ruoth ogolo mar konyo jo-Yahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1"/>Chiengʼno ruoth Ahasuerus nomiyo Esta mwandu mag Haman, jasik jo-Yahudi. Kendo Modekai nobiro e nyim ruoth, nimar Esta nosenyise ni en watne. <verse eid="EST 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2"/>Ruoth nogolo terene mane oyudo osegolo kuom Haman, mi nomiyo Modekai. Kendo Esta nokete mondo orit mwandu mane mag Haman.<verse eid="EST 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3"/>Esta nochako ohombo ruoth mopodho e tiende koywak. Ne okwaye mondo oketh chenro marach mane Haman ja-Agag oseloso, mondo otimne jo-Yahudi. <verse eid="EST 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4"/>Eka ruoth notingʼo ludhe mar dhahabu ne Esta bangʼe noa malo mochungʼ e nyim ruoth.<verse eid="EST 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5"/>Nowacho niya, “Ka ber ne ruoth kendo ka ayudo ngʼwono e wangʼi kendo kiparo ni en gima ber timo kendo ka imor koda, to yie mondo igol chik mondiki maketho mano mane Haman wuod Hamedatha, ja-Agag oketo mondo otiek jo-Yahudi e gwenge duto ma ruoth orito. <verse eid="EST 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6"/>Nimar ere kaka dalingʼ alingʼa ka aneno masira mabiro ne ogandana? Kata ere kaka dalingʼ alingʼa ka aneno ka idwaro tiek joodwa.”<verse eid="EST 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7"/>Ruoth Ahasuerus nodwoko Esta ma mikache gi Modekai ma ja-Yahudi niya, Nikech Haman ne obuko jo-Yahudi ma ema omiyo asemiyo Esta mwandune, to en to osenege, kongʼawe e yath. <verse eid="EST 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8"/>Koro ndik chik machielo gi nying ruoth kar jo-Yahudi kaka ineno ni berni, kendo iketie sei mar nying ruoth bangʼe ketie ranyisi mar tere mar ruoth, nimar gik moko duto mondiki e nying ruoth kendo oketie tere mar ruoth ok nyal loki kata kethi.<verse eid="EST 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9"/>Kuom mano, noluong jondiko mag ruoth chiengʼ tarik piero ariyo gadek dwe mar adek miluongo ni Sivan. Negindiko weche duto mane Modekai ochiko ne ondiki ne jo-Yahudi, askeche, jotelo, kod joka ruoth modak e pinje mia achiel gi piero ariyo gabiriyo kochakore e piny India nyaka chop Kush. Chikegi nondiki e dhok mar piny ka piny kata mana mar jo-Yahudi bende nondiki e dhogi giwegi. <verse eid="EST 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10"/>Modekai nondiko gi teko mar ruoth Ahasuerus mokete sei gi tere mar ruoth bangʼe nooro barupego gi jongʼwech maringo matek koidho farese mag ruoth.<verse eid="EST 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11"/>Chik mane ruoth ogolono noyiene jo-Yahudi man e mier madongo duto mondo giritre kendgi; kendo mondo giketh kendo ginegi mi gitieki joma obiro nigi gi gige lweny moa e oganda moro amora, kata gwengʼ moro momonjogi gi mondgi gi nyithindgi kendo gipe mwandu mag wasikgi. <verse eid="EST 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12"/>Chiengʼ mane oyier ne jo-Yahudi mondo otimie magi e gwenge duto mag pinyruodh Ahasuerus ne en tarik apar gadek dwe mar apar gariyo dwe miluongo ni Adar. <verse eid="EST 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13"/>Chikno nyaka landi e pinje duto kendo ne ogendini duto, mondo jo-Yahudi oikre ne chiengʼ chulo kuor ne wasikgi.<verse eid="EST 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14"/>Joote mane oidho farese maka ruoth noringo matek kadhi kaluwore gi chik mane ruoth ogolo. Milomeno bende nogo e ohinga mar Susa.<verse eid="EST 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15"/>Modekai nowuok e nyim ruoth korwakore gi law marambulu mokikore gi rachar, osimbo mar duongʼ mar dhahabu, to gi kandho maralik molos law mayom. Kendo dala maduongʼ mar Susa notimo nyasi gi mor malich. <verse eid="EST 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16"/>To ne jo-Yahudi, ne en kinde mar mor, gi ilo kod pak. <verse eid="EST 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17"/>Kamoro amora e gwenge kendo e mier madongo kuonde mane barup ruoth oterie, jo-Yahudi nobedo gi mor ahinya kane giyweyo kendo gitimo nyasi. Joma ok jo-Yahudi nobedo ka jo-Yahudi nikech luoro mar jo-Yahudi nomakogi.<verse eid="EST 8:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Yahudi olocho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1"/>Baruwa mar chik ruoth ne onego chak tich chiengʼ tarik apar gadek dwe mar apar gariyo miluongo ni Adar. Chiengʼ ma jowasik jo-Yahudi nogeno logie, wach nolokore mi jo-Yahudi ema koro noloyo jogo mane ochayogigo. <verse eid="EST 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2"/>Jo-Yahudi nochokore e mier madongo e gwenge duto manie pinyruoth Ahasuerus mondo gimonj joma ne dwa tiekogi. Ne onge ngʼama ne nyalo chungʼ e nyimgi nikech ogendini mamoko duto noluorogi. <verse eid="EST 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3"/>Kendo jodongo duto mag gwenge, gi askeche, gi jotelo, gi jorit chik mag ruoth nokonyo jo-Yahudi nikech negiluoro Modekai. <verse eid="EST 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4"/>Modekai ne en ngʼama duongʼ e dala ruoth; humbe nolandore e gwenge duto kendo tekone ne osiko medore ameda.<verse eid="EST 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5"/>Jo-Yahudi nogoyo jowasikgi duto ka ginegogi gi ligangla kendo negitiekogi, mine gitimo gima gihero ne joma ne ochayogi. <verse eid="EST 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6"/>To e ohinga mar Susa, jo-Yahudi nonego motieko ji mia abich. <verse eid="EST 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7"/>Bende neginego Parshandatha, Dalfon, Aspatha, <verse eid="EST 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8"/>Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha, <verse eid="EST 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9"/>Parmashta, Arisai, Aridai, to gi Vaizatha, <verse eid="EST 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10"/>mane gin yawuowi apar mag Haman wuod Hamedatha, jawasik jo-Yahudi. To jo-Yahudi ne ok oyako gimoro amora.<verse eid="EST 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11"/>Kar romb ji mane onegi ei ohinga mar Susa noter ne ruoth e odiechiengʼno. <verse eid="EST 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12"/>Ruoth nowachone Esta ma mikache niya, “Jo-Yahudi osenego ji mia abich motieko gi yawuot Haman apar ei ohinga mar Susa kende. To koro kare gisetimo angʼo e gwenge man e pinyruoth? Sani to koro angʼo kendo midwaro mondo atimni? Kwayoni en angʼo? Mano bende ibiro miyi.”<verse eid="EST 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13"/>Esta nodwoko niya, “Ka berni ruoth, to yie mondo jo-Yahudi man Susa kiny ochak otim gima gisetimo kawuononi kendo yie mondo ringre yawuot Haman apar-ka mondo olier e yath minegoe ji.”<verse eid="EST 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14"/>Eka ruoth nochiko mondo mano otimre ma chikno nogol e Susa, mine giliero ringre yawuot Haman apar-ka e yath. <verse eid="EST 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15"/>Jo-Yahudi man Susa nobiro kaachiel tarik apar gangʼwen dwe mar Adar, mine ginego ji mia adek e Susa, to ne ok giyako girgi mora amora.<verse eid="EST 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16"/>E kindeno jo-Yahudi mamoko mane ni e gwenge mag pinyruoth bende nochokore mondo gisir kendo gigengʼ wasigu. Neginego ji moromo alufu piero abiriyo gabich, to ne ok giyako girgi moro amora. <verse eid="EST 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17"/>Mano notimore tarik apar gadek e dwe mar Adar, to tarik apar gangʼwen ne giyweyo ma giketo odiechiengno obedonegi odiechieng mor kod nyasi.<verse eid="EST 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyasi mar Purim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18"/>To jo-Yahudi modak Susa nochokore tarik apar gadek kod apar gangʼwen, to kane ochopo tarik apar gabich ne giyweyo mi odiechiengno nobedonegi odiechieng mor kod nyasi.<verse eid="EST 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19"/>Mano ema omiyo jo-Yahudi modak e gwenge to moloyo modak e mier pod rito tarik apar gangʼwen mar dwe mar Adar kaka chiengʼ mor mar timo nyasi, kendo en odiechiengʼ ma gimiyoe ngʼato ka ngʼato mich.<verse eid="EST 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20"/>Modekai nondiko gigo mane otimore, nooro barupe ni jo-Yahudi duto e gwenge maboyo kod machiegni mane ni e bwo loch ruoth Ahasuerus, <verse eid="EST 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21"/>kochikogi mondo gitim nyasini higa ka higa, tarik apar gangʼwen gi apar gabich mar dwe mar Adar, <verse eid="EST 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22"/>nikech e kindego ema ne jo-Yahudi otony e lwet wasikgi kendo e dweno ema kuyo margi nolokore mor kendo ywakgi ne olokore nyiero. Kindego nyaka bed kinde mag timo nyasi mag mor ka gioro mich mag chiemo ne jowetegi kendo mich moko bende ne jomoko modhier.<verse eid="EST 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23"/>Omiyo jo-Yahudi noyie dhi nyime gitimo nyasi mane gisechako timo ka gitimo gima Modekai nosendikonegi. <verse eid="EST 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24"/>Negitimo kamano nikech Haman wuod Hamedatha, ma ja-Agag, ma jasik jo-Yahudi duto, nosechano mondo otiek jo-Yahudi kogoyo ombulu (miluongo ni <char style="tl">pur</char>) mondo oneg-gi kendo otiekgi. <verse eid="EST 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25"/>To ka wach marachno nochopo ne ruoth, noketo mondo ondik chike moko mamiyo chenro maricho mane Haman ochano ne jo-Yahudi odog ne en owuon, kendo ni oliergi e yath, en kaachiel gi yawuote. <verse eid="EST 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26"/>(Emomiyo nochak odiechiengego ni Purim kaluwore gi nying ombulu miluongo ni <char style="tl">pur</char>.) Nikech gik moko duto mondiki e baruwani kendo nikech gik moko mane gineno kod mane otimorenegi, <verse eid="EST 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27"/>jo-Yahudi nokawo wachno ka margi mondo obed timgi ne gin giwegi to gi nyikwagi mabiro to gi ji duto madwaro riwore kodgi ni nyaka rit ndalo ariyogo higa ka higa, e yo moketi kendo e kinde moseketi. <verse eid="EST 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28"/>Ndalogi onego par kendo riti e tienge duto mag dhoudi, e gwenge, kendo e mier madongo duto. Kendo ndalo Purim-gi mondo orit nyaka chiengʼ ma ok jo-Yahudi oweyo ma ok otimoe nyasi, bende wich kik wil kodgi e kind nyikwau.<verse eid="EST 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29"/>Omiyo Esta ma mikach ruoth ma nyar Abihail kod Modekai ma ja-Yahudi, nondiko gi teko kod chir mondo ojiw baruwa mar ariyo kuom wach Purim. <verse eid="EST 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30"/>Kendo Modekai nooro barupe ne jo-Yahudi duto man e gwenge mia achiel gi piero ariyo gabiriyo mag pinyruodh Ahasuerus, barupego notingʼo weche mag miyo chunygi mor kod jiwo chunygi, <verse eid="EST 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31"/>mar chako loso ndalo mag Purim e kindegi mowinjore, mana kaka Modekai ma ja-Yahudi gi Esta ma mikach ruoth nosechikogi. Barupego bende ne omiyo jo-Yahudi gi nyikwagi chike moko moket kuom wach tweyo chiemo kendo kuom wach ywak. <verse eid="EST 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32"/>Chik mane Esta ogolo nojiwo chike mag Purim, kendo nondikgi e kitabu.<verse eid="EST 9:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Duongʼ mar Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1"/>Ruoth Ahasuerus noketo osuru e lochne duto nyaka e dho nembe man mabor. <verse eid="EST 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2"/>Weche duto mag ruoth gi tekone kod timbene madongo kaachiel gi duongʼ mane omiyo Modekai ondiki e kitabu mag loch mag ruodhi Media gi Pasia. <verse eid="EST 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3"/>Modekai ma ja-Yahudi ne en jalup ruoth Ahasuerus, noyudo duongʼ mongʼere e kind jo-Yahudi; kendo ogandane mangʼeny nohere, nikech notiyo matek mondo jo-Yahudi duto odag maber.<verse eid="EST 10:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10"/>
</usx>
